'''Rongokurai's Boon''' is a [[buff]] that grants {{c|mod|You cannot be Damaged}} for 2 seconds, with a 30 second cooldown<ref name="Rongokurai's Boon Effect" />. This buff can only be granted by a {{il|Imperfect Guardian Turtle}}, {{il|Guardian Turtle}}, or {{il|Perfect Guardian Turtle}} [[spectre]].
==Version history==
{{Version history table header}}
{{Version history table row|3.28.0h|
* The Rongokurai's Boon buff from Guardian Turtle Spectres is no longer affected by modifiers to Buff Expiry Rate, such as Temporal Chains.
}}
{{Version history table row|3.23.0|
* Introduced to the game.
}}
{{Version history table end}}

